  "description": "She has a good personality, is popular, and has a lot of money: Gu Do-Yeon, the daughter of the perfect G company president. However, Do-Yeon's step-sister Gu Yi-Seo is just unlucky and annoying. Who in the world is perfect? In the end, Yi-Seo secretly hides in an office to dig up Do-Yeon's weakness. There, she discovers a completely different side to the Do-Yeon she knew. \n\n(Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Chapter count includes a prologue.\n\\- Part of Lezhin's Gwanggong Collection (광공단편선). A gwanggong (광공, hanja: 狂攻) character is obsessed with the object of their desire, similar to the Japanese \"yandere\". Scanlations have erroneously translated this to \"GwangGong Apartment/Industrial Complex\", which may have caused confusion.*",
